<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Oriental Chemical H1 net tumbles.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Oriental Chemical H1 net tumbles.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				     630 vs 5,654</p>
<p>    Net					    7.70 vs 52.32</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			 11.12 vs 75.59</p>
<p>    Turnover				   283.50 vs 270.04</p>
<p>Note - Oriental Chemical Industries Co Ltd is one of South Korea's leading producers of chemical products. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association. -- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5645</p>
